Cost per traffic™ offers performance-based charges that are directly related to Joe’s store traffic. With power cost per traffic™, Joe now will only be charged at a performance-based rate for each traffic sent into his store.
Cost per traffic™ provides powerful KPIs for physical store owners to understand campaign performance and establish customer profiles base on visits.


