He is survived by his wife, Theresa F. McLaughlin; children, Thomas J. McL[aughlin] Jr. and his wife Jayne, Theresa Karole, Michael McL[aughlin], Maureen McGinle and her husband Lawrence and Ellen M. McLaughlin; grandchildren, Katherine, Devin, Thomas, John, Michael and Ashley; and sister, Mary Kate Jensen.
Visitation will from 2-5 p.m. Sunday at the[ Vander] Plaat[ Funeral] Home, 257 Godwin Ave., Wyckoff. A funeral Mass will be celebrated at 11 a.m. Monday at Church of the Nativity, 315[ Prospect] St., Midland Park. Interment will follow at Ascension[ Cemetery] in M[onse]y, N.Y.

